  "findings": [
    "Live mt-boot selects mt_cpu_psci_ops rather than generic psci",
    "mt_psci_cpu_kill logs PSCI kill failure then returns MTCMOS result instead of that error",
    "MT8163 MTCMOS power-down has WFI, SRAM and power-status busy waits without timeout",
    "Generic affinity-info absence can return success without firmware off confirmation",
    "One online CPU and generic kernel shutdown completion are insufficient independent off proofs"
